Package: handsometable
Title: Spreadsheet-Style Tables for R and 'shiny' with 'Handsontable'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Casey", "Aguilar-Gervase", , "97caguilar@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Maya", "Gans", role = "aut"),
    person("Handsoncode sp. z o.o.", role = c("cph"),
           comment = "Bundled 'Handsontable' JavaScript library")
  )
Description: An 'htmlwidgets' wrapper around the 'Handsontable' JavaScript
    library. Turns a data frame into a styled, spreadsheet-style table with
    per-column filters, click-to-expand long text, and column freezing and
    hiding, for use in R Markdown, Quarto and 'shiny' apps. The bundled
    'Handsontable' library has its own license: it is free for
    non-commercial use and evaluation, and commercial use requires a
    license key from Handsontable.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
